===Etymology===
From {{bor|en|moh|tkaronto||where trees stand in water}}, originally referring to the strait between {{w|Lake Simcoe}} and {{w|Lake Couchiching}}.<ref name="ety">{{cite-web|en |url=https://www.theglobeandmail.com/news/national/a-defining-moment-for-tkaronto/article18432992/ |last=Gray |first=Jeff |date=2003-10-17 |accessdate=2022-09-23 |work={{w|The Globe and Mail}} |title=A defining moment for tkaronto}}</ref> Compare {{l|moh|''karón:ta''||tree}} from {{der|en|iro-nor-pro|*-ɹõt-}}.

